    {
      "id": "529394",
      "text": "Each time Claude Code does something, it emits an event. Examples include calling a tool, asking for permission, and drawing part of the screen. A mod is a function that hooks into one of these events. A mod can run before the event, after it, or instead of it. It can also wrap the event, running code both before and after\nClaude Code每次执行操作时，都会触发一个事件。这些事件包括调用工具、请求权限、绘制部分界面等。\nmod是一个可以接入上述任意事件的函数。\nmod可以在事件执行前运行，也可以在事件执行后运行，还可以直接替代事件本身运行。\n它也可以对事件进行包装，在事件运行的前后都执行自定义代码。",
      "time": "21:20",
      "sender_name": "大魔王",
      "sender_id": 871092736
    },
